msgid "Migrate legacy configuration and interface access"
msgstr "迁移旧配置与接口访问"

msgid ""
"Use this guide to migrate an older HAL/OSAL/Kconfig consumer to the current "
"Source SDK generation. Keep a fixed source revision while migrating. The "
"platform retains typed factory plus C polymorphic interfaces; it changes "
"instance generation and ownership rather than replacing interfaces with a "
"runtime service registry. The [compatibility contract](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md) owns version and interface epoch behavior."
msgstr ""
"本指南将旧 HAL/OSAL/Kconfig 消费者迁移到当前 Source SDK 代际。迁移期间固定源码版本。平台保留类型化工厂与 C "
"多态接口，改变实例生成和所有权，不以运行时服务注册表替代接口。[兼容合同](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md)拥有版本与接口 epoch 行为。"

msgid ""
"Obtain the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md) "
"first; keep the old consumer in its own checkout while validating the new "
"one."
msgstr "先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)；验证新消费工程时，将旧消费工程保留在自己的 checkout 中。"

msgid "Legacy pattern"
msgstr "旧模式"

msgid "Current migration action"
msgstr "当前迁移动作"

msgid "Kconfig or cache macros selecting instances"
msgstr "用 Kconfig 或缓存宏选择实例"

msgid "Write one complete schema-2 TOML assembly"
msgstr "编写一份完整 schema-2 TOML 装配"

msgid "Macro-driven object construction during lookup"
msgstr "查找期间以宏构造对象"

msgid "Use generated static objects; factory lookup only returns identity"
msgstr "使用生成静态对象；factory 查找仅返回身份"

msgid "HAL/OSAL implementation pointers in products"
msgstr "产品持有 HAL/OSAL 实现指针"

msgid "Include public Nexus APIs and generated `nexus_factory.h`"
msgstr "包含公共 Nexus API 和生成的 `nexus_factory.h`"

msgid "First SPI/I2C child used as bus"
msgstr "以首个 SPI/I2C 子端点充当总线"

msgid "Obtain controller and endpoint separately with their typed getters"
msgstr "通过各自类型化获取函数分别取得控制器和端点"

msgid "Global maximum pools or default task"
msgstr "全局最大池或默认任务"

msgid "Provide exact selected buffers, slots and application workers"
msgstr "明确提供所选缓冲区、槽和应用执行任务"

msgid "Cancel/timeout followed by immediate reuse"
msgstr "Cancel/超时后立即复用"

msgid "Keep borrow until acquire-observed SETTLED and observer drain"
msgstr "保持借用到 acquire 观察 SETTLED 并排空观察者"

msgid "Platform-owned product partition or policy"
msgstr "平台拥有产品分区或策略"

msgid "Move reservations, roles and recovery to the external product"
msgstr "将预留、角色和恢复移入外部产品"

msgid "Move one complete assembly"
msgstr "迁移一份完整装配"

msgid ""
"Inspect this maintained Native assembly; it is complete, not a fragment:"
msgstr "检查以下维护中的 Native 装配；它是完整输入，不是片段："

msgid "Current schema-2 Native UART input."
msgstr "当前 schema-2 Native UART 输入。"

msgid ""
"From the repository root, execute the actual parser and generation path:"
msgstr "从仓库根执行实际 parser 与生成路径："

msgid ""
"Use a new output path you own. Check `resolved.json` and generated headers; "
"never author the resolved output or reuse stale generated files after a "
"failure. Legacy schema-1 JSON exists only for explicit migration fixtures. A"
" failed TOML does not fall back to JSON, Kconfig, old headers or cache "
"values."
msgstr ""
"使用自己拥有的新输出路径。检查 `resolved.json` 和生成头文件；不得编写 resolved 输出，失败后不得复用过期生成文件。旧 "
"schema-1 JSON 仅用于明确的迁移夹具。TOML 失败不回退 JSON、Kconfig、旧头文件或缓存值。"

msgid "Move access and lifecycle together"
msgstr "同时迁移访问与生命周期"

msgid ""
"Use compact typed IDs from the current assembly and check getter NULL "
"results. Getter names and ID constants are generated from authored instance "
"names; IDs are not persistent IDs or a binary ABI. Optional nominal strong "
"IDs and capability records require their explicit configuration. Start "
"hardware through `nx_platform_start()` and inspect both primary and cleanup "
"results. After successful startup, ordinary I/O uses the returned face "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"使用当前装配的紧凑 typed ID，并检查获取函数 NULL 结果。获取函数名称和 ID 常量来自人工编写的实例名；ID 不是持久身份或二进制 "
"ABI。可选名义强类型 ID 与 capability 记录必须明确配置。通过 `nx_platform_start()` 启动硬件，同时检查 "
"primary 和 cleanup 结果。成功启动后，日常 I/O 直接使用返回接口面。"

msgid ""
"Convert synchronous and asynchronous calls according to their actual mode. "
"For accepted requests, migrate storage lifetime, service/wait progress, "
"cancellation, settlement and shutdown together. [The async "
"tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) executes these failure paths; replacing "
"a function spelling alone is insufficient."
msgstr ""
"依据实际模式转换同步与异步调用。对于已接受的请求，同时迁移存储生命周期、service/wait "
"进度、取消、结束与停机。[异步教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)执行这些失败路径；只替换函数名不足以完成迁移。"

msgid ""
"Build an independent relocated [SDK consumer](../tutorials/source-sdk.md), "
"then link the exact MCU configuration with the locked compiler. Retain "
"evidence for the migrated source and configuration. Old HAL/OSAL "
"documentation remains historical; a redirect does not make an old API "
"contract equivalent to a new one."
msgstr ""
"构建独立搬移的 [SDK 消费者](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)，再用锁定编译器链接精确 MCU "
"配置。保留迁移源码/配置的证据。旧 HAL/OSAL 文档保持历史身份；redirect 不使旧 API 合同等同于新合同。"

msgid "Update private source integrations"
msgstr "更新私有源码接入"

msgid "The SoC/IP source reorganization keeps public C include paths, CMake target names, authored family identifiers and TOML selections. Ordinary public consumers rebuild against the chosen source revision. Maintainers of private providers, source auditors or custom SDK packaging must update the internal paths below; obsolete production family packages are not compatibility entry points."
msgstr "SoC/IP 源码重组保持公共 C include 路径、CMake target 名称、装配中的家族标识与 TOML 选择。普通公共接口消费者按所选源码版本重新构建。私有 provider、源码审计器或自定义 SDK 打包的维护者须更新下列内部路径；旧生产家族包不是兼容入口。"

msgid "Previous private source"
msgstr "原私有源码"

msgid "Current owner"
msgstr "当前归属"

msgid "`tools/configure/providers/native/` production modules"
msgstr "`tools/configure/providers/native/` 生产模块"

msgid "`soc/native/configure/`"
msgstr "`soc/native/configure/`"

