msgstr "`tools/configure/providers/<stm32-family>/` 生产模块"

msgid "`soc/stm32/<family>/configure/`"
msgstr "`soc/stm32/<family>/configure/`"

msgid "`tools/configure/providers/<gd32-family>/` production modules"
msgstr "`tools/configure/providers/<gd32-family>/` 生产模块"

msgid "`soc/gd32/<family>/configure/`"
msgstr "`soc/gd32/<family>/configure/`"

msgid "Family configuration tests inside provider packages"
msgstr "provider 包内的家族配置测试"

msgid "`tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/` in the existing tool-test domain"
msgstr "既有工具测试执行域中的 `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`"

msgid "`soc/common/uart_v1_channel_dma.*`"
msgstr "`soc/common/uart_v1_channel_dma.*`"

msgid "`drivers/uart/uart_v1_channel_dma/`"
msgstr "`drivers/uart/uart_v1_channel_dma/`"

msgid "`soc/common/i2c_v1_async.*` and `soc/common/i2c_v2.*`"
msgstr "`soc/common/i2c_v1_async.*` 与 `soc/common/i2c_v2.*`"

msgid "`drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/` and `drivers/i2c/i2c_v2/`"
msgstr "`drivers/i2c/i2c_v1_async/` 与 `drivers/i2c/i2c_v2/`"

msgid "`soc/common/legacy_adc.c`, `legacy_pwm.c`, `legacy_flash.c`"
msgstr "`soc/common/legacy_adc.c`, `legacy_pwm.c`, `legacy_flash.c`"

msgid "`drivers/adc/legacy_adc/`, `drivers/timer/legacy_pwm/`, `drivers/flash/legacy_flash/`"
msgstr "`drivers/adc/legacy_adc/`, `drivers/timer/legacy_pwm/`, `drivers/flash/legacy_flash/`"

msgid "`soc/common/legacy_devices.h`"
msgstr "`soc/common/legacy_devices.h`"

msgid "Split into the three corresponding private driver headers; include only the required contract"
msgstr "拆成三个对应的私有 driver 头文件；只 include 所需合同"

msgid "`soc/common/stm32_identity.h`"
msgstr "`soc/common/stm32_identity.h`"

msgid "`soc/stm32/common/stm32_identity.h`"
msgstr "`soc/stm32/common/stm32_identity.h`"

msgid "The explicit provider map, descriptor and shared leaf contracts remain in `tools/configure/providers/`; common parsing, typed IR and atomic bundle handling remain in `tools/configure/`. `soc/common/uart_control.h` remains a cross-vendor SoC collaboration contract. Do not infer either module or source paths from a family-name prefix: use the maintained descriptor and explicit CMake target."
msgstr "显式 provider map、descriptor 与共享叶子合同保留在 `tools/configure/providers/`；通用解析、typed IR 与原子 bundle 处理保留在 `tools/configure/`。`soc/common/uart_control.h` 仍是跨厂家 SoC 协作合同。不得根据家族名称前缀推断模块或源码路径：使用维护中的 descriptor 与显式 CMake target。"

msgid "For a private extension, update imports and private includes, declared configuration inputs, source-observation coverage and the required SDK payload together. Resolve the same exact assembly and compare effective decisions before running its actual provider contracts and relocated consumer. A path migration does not establish new supported modes, hardware behavior or physical qualification. The [provider guide](provider-porting.md) owns new integration and lifecycle work; the {download}`48-task ledger <../design/soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>` records this refactor's implementation and execution separately."
msgstr "私有扩展应一起更新 import、私有 include、声明的配置输入、源码观察覆盖和 SDK 必需 payload。解析同一精确装配并比较有效决策，再执行其真实 provider 合同与搬移 consumer。路径迁移不建立新支持模式、硬件行为或物理资格。[provider 指南](provider-porting.md)维护新接入与生命周期工作；{download}`48 项台账 <../design/soc-ip-layout-execution.csv>`分别记录本次重构的实现与执行。"
